prompt:
Update roadmap status based on release. Context:

Version released: {{current_version}}
Features in this release: {{changelog-analyzer.features}}
Repo: {{repo_url}}

Your tasks:
1. Review existing roadmap.md or README roadmap section
2. Mark features in {{changelog-analyzer.features}} as ✓ DONE
3. Propose 3-5 next steps based on open GitHub issues (if available)
4. Estimate effort for each next step (Low/Medium/High)

Return JSON:
{
  "completed_items": ["feature-1", "feature-2"],
  "next_items": [{"title": "", "effort": "Low|Medium|High", "description": ""}],
  "roadmap_content": "Updated roadmap.md or roadmap section (if exists)",
  "has_roadmap_file": true|false
}
